sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Owner
    participant A as Attacker (reads the traffic)
    participant E as Empty replica (just restarted)
    participant H as Other replicas
    O->>E: STORE(position 1)
    A-->>A: sees it, signs a forged position 2 with the DID,<br/>the genesis and the path it read, and a key of its own
    A->>E: STORE(forged 2)
    Note over E: its key and code do not reach the root at 2
    E-->>A: InvalidRecord, nobody asked, nothing stored
    A->>E: STORE(genuine position 0, read on the wire earlier)
    Note over E: in form and signed by key 0, but maybe superseded
    E->>H: FindHash(key)
    H-->>E: 1 and hash of record 1
    E->>H: FindValue(key) to the closest that claimed 1
    H-->>E: record 1, in the tree at 1, signature verifies
    Note over E: store record 1
    E-->>A: Stale
